description: Project-wide AI agent instructions
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow all instructions in @AGENTS.md in this repository root.

When working in a subdirectory, also read the local AGENTS.md if one exists.

Key rules for in-editor work:
1. Self-contained product code -- do not import from sibling *app* repos.
   Browser SDK/embeds come only from `@contextrocket/*` (local `file:` to
   `cr-sdk` during development).
2. i18n keys for strings -- all user-facing text goes through `createT(locale)` / `t("KEY")` in `src/i18n/keys.ts`; no hardcoded English in markup.
3. Live chat goes through the embed widget (`public/embed/widget.js` from
   `@contextrocket/embed-chat`) with publishable `PUBLIC_*` credentials --
   never mint server secrets in the browser.
